WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.208
You’ve read the chapter. But can you answer a question on your own?

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:12.000
For Karnataka SSLC, NoteStack breaks each chapter into small, guided steps.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:20.792
Take real numbers. What is the highest common factor of twelve and eighteen? Try it before opening the solution.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.167
Compare the factors. Both numbers share one, two, three and six. So the highest is six.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:36.917
Chapter checks help students see what needs another try. Parents can ask, which step made sense today?

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:44.000
